"""
Enable direct MAVLink communication using libmav from a server component.

 Unlike MavlinkDirect, this does not require a discovered system: it sends from
 the local server component, which makes it suitable for broadcasting messages
 (e.g. as an autopilot or custom component) without a connected counterpart.
"""

